(4587561, 662037, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very sweet. You might have taken down the contrast a bit to lessen the brights on noodle''s shirt. But such a lovely spontaneous chuckle :-)</td>', 'Very sweet. You might have taken down the contrast a bit to lessen the brights on noodle''s shirt. But such a lovely spontaneous chuckle :-)', '2008-03-26 03:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
