(4587722, 662275, 88204, '<td valign="top">This shot to me captures true intimacy. Fun, love, togetherness. I love the composition and the coloring. Great expressions. Eyes looking down makes me feel like they''re sharing a private intimate moment. Great shot!</td>', 'This shot to me captures true intimacy. Fun, love, togetherness. I love the composition and the coloring. Great expressions. Eyes looking down makes me feel like they''re sharing a private intimate moment. Great shot!', '2008-03-26 06:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587724, 662240, 88204, '<td valign="top">Train makes for a simple yet interesting background. Foot in the air shows some flirt. Daytime makes me wonder if they snuck away from work. His hand in his pocket makes him seem a little more distant and less intimate. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Train makes for a simple yet interesting background. Foot in the air shows some flirt. Daytime makes me wonder if they snuck away from work. His hand in his pocket makes him seem a little more distant and less intimate. Very nice shot.', '2008-03-26 06:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587729, 660284, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of family intimacy. Close crop is nice. One thing that could have made it even better is if the daughter''s expression looked a little happier. This expression make her look a little like she''s had one too many pictures taken. Great shot that resonates with me because we have a 7 year old daughter and do the same every night... of course I didn''t think to capture it on film, so great work!</td>', 'This is a great capture of family intimacy. Close crop is nice. One thing that could have made it even better is if the daughter''s expression looked a little happier. This expression make her look a little like she''s had one too many pictures taken. Great shot that resonates with me because we have a 7 year old daughter and do the same every night... of course I didn''t think to capture it on film, so great work!', '2008-03-26 06:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587731, 661681, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful people, beautiful tones. Love the slight brown tint, the dress flowing in the breeze, the composition, simple background, placement of flowers, capture of the kiss moment. Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful people, beautiful tones. Love the slight brown tint, the dress flowing in the breeze, the composition, simple background, placement of flowers, capture of the kiss moment. Wonderful shot!', '2008-03-26 06:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587734, 662256, 88204, '<td valign="top">Good concept... it captures intimacy. The composition it a little haphazard... maybe s lower angle with shallow DoF, or maybe capture a close up of just the nose on the tail or baby''s face. Lighting looks like on-camera flash which is a bit harsh.</td>', 'Good concept... it captures intimacy. The composition it a little haphazard... maybe s lower angle with shallow DoF, or maybe capture a close up of just the nose on the tail or baby''s face. Lighting looks like on-camera flash which is a bit harsh.', '2008-03-26 06:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587740, 662174, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great colors, beautiful skin tones. I love the detail you got in the sky... I''d love to know more about how you did it. Composition is great, lighting works well. One small thing for me is that I think of intimacy as a connection between two people, although I understand this situation could lead to intimacy, but that aspect is missing. Still very well done!</td>', 'Great colors, beautiful skin tones. I love the detail you got in the sky... I''d love to know more about how you did it. Composition is great, lighting works well. One small thing for me is that I think of intimacy as a connection between two people, although I understand this situation could lead to intimacy, but that aspect is missing. Still very well done!', '2008-03-26 06:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587742, 660994, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and expressions. Her expression almost looks like she has a question of what he''s thinking which makes it seem like their intimacy may be slightly off at this moment. Still a great shot.</td>', 'Great lighting and expressions. Her expression almost looks like she has a question of what he''s thinking which makes it seem like their intimacy may be slightly off at this moment. Still a great shot.', '2008-03-26 06:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
