(4588454, 661881, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The lighting is really harsh though.  It looks pretty noisy also.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The lighting is really harsh though.  It looks pretty noisy also.', '2008-03-26 10:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588460, 662275, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nicely posed.  The white background is unfortunate since it looks like it merges with his back and really distracts.  A different angle would really help that issue.</td>', 'Very nicely posed.  The white background is unfortunate since it looks like it merges with his back and really distracts.  A different angle would really help that issue.', '2008-03-26 10:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588464, 662174, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how much this says Intimacy, but I really like the shot and procesing.</td>', 'I''m not sure how much this says Intimacy, but I really like the shot and procesing.', '2008-03-26 10:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588522, 661937, 66201, '<td valign="top">Best of the foot photos. 9</td>', 'Best of the foot photos. 9', '2008-03-26 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588527, 661866, 66201, '<td valign="top">Really gorgeous: if this weren''t a Basic Challenge, it could have done with some dodge on mom''s face.... Love the clarity and composition...8</td>', 'Really gorgeous: if this weren''t a Basic Challenge, it could have done with some dodge on mom''s face.... Love the clarity and composition...8', '2008-03-26 10:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588529, 661728, 91900, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF, head cut off</td>', 'Nice DoF, head cut off', '2008-03-26 10:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588536, 661681, 91900, '<td valign="top">Maybe water should be darker, or something else to provide more contrast? Nce and sharp.</td>', 'Maybe water should be darker, or something else to provide more contrast? Nce and sharp.', '2008-03-26 10:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588553, 661390, 91900, '<td valign="top">Plant seems distracting to me, interferes with his hand that could have been a point of interest.  Nice softness in the background.  I little red-eye, but can''t remember right now if that is correctable under the Rules, so just an observation. A treasure.</td>', 'Plant seems distracting to me, interferes with his hand that could have been a point of interest.  Nice softness in the background.  I little red-eye, but can''t remember right now if that is correctable under the Rules, so just an observation. A treasure.', '2008-03-26 10:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588562, 661685, 91900, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little tilt to the right, maybe a rotate would improve? Nice framing with fence.</td>', 'Seems to be a little tilt to the right, maybe a rotate would improve? Nice framing with fence.', '2008-03-26 10:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588567, 661976, 39679, '<td valign="top">s</td>', 's', '2008-03-26 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588581, 660998, 327, '<td valign="top">Great expressions here and I like their positions. I just wish it was cropped a bit tighter. All in all good shot.</td>', 'Great expressions here and I like their positions. I just wish it was cropped a bit tighter. All in all good shot.', '2008-03-26 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4588583, 660969, 91900, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  I assume this is Bocce or related.  Would have the balls randomly oriented been better? Or the other hand the lines may be better.  Not sure.  Good. Nice light and shadow,</td>', 'Nice macro.  I assume this is Bocce or related.  Would have the balls randomly oriented been better? Or the other hand the lines may be better.  Not sure.  Good. Nice light and shadow,', '2008-03-26 11:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
