(4589227, 661577, 84124, '<td valign="top">There are so many good shots in this challenge, it''s tough to guess which ones are going to do well, but this one should.  There''s a bit of motional blur on the girls face, but that''s a minor nitpick, the transition from shadows to hilights work perfectly in this shot.  Anyone who looks at this and isn''t taken back to a simpler time must have been comatose during their "wonder years".  Back to bump up and add to favs.</td>', 'There are so many good shots in this challenge, it''s tough to guess which ones are going to do well, but this one should.  There''s a bit of motional blur on the girls face, but that''s a minor nitpick, the transition from shadows to hilights work perfectly in this shot.  Anyone who looks at this and isn''t taken back to a simpler time must have been comatose during their "wonder years".  Back to bump up and add to favs.', '2008-03-26 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
