(4590285, 662198, 66635, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure, the choice of black and white, the perspective and the way the straight lines curve on the sides.  The only thing I dislike is the subject - but that''s not why I''m giving you a DNMC and a low score.  I''ve got to say DNMC overall because there''s nothing intimate about it.  Maybe you were thinking "private?"  Ok, question.  Is he shitting or masturbating?  If the latter, then I guess you''re making a joke about how photography gets him off.  In that case, it could be shoe-horned into the challenge.  But, if that''s the case, I would recommend against putting him on the toilet, because, if he''s shitting, it''s a DNMC.  I wish I knew what you were up to before I scored this one.</td>', 'I like the exposure, the choice of black and white, the perspective and the way the straight lines curve on the sides.  The only thing I dislike is the subject - but that''s not why I''m giving you a DNMC and a low score.  I''ve got to say DNMC overall because there''s nothing intimate about it.  Maybe you were thinking "private?"  Ok, question.  Is he shitting or masturbating?  If the latter, then I guess you''re making a joke about how photography gets him off.  In that case, it could be shoe-horned into the challenge.  But, if that''s the case, I would recommend against putting him on the toilet, because, if he''s shitting, it''s a DNMC.  I wish I knew what you were up to before I scored this one.', '2008-03-26 23:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
