(4592282, 661132, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good composition and heartwarming photo.</td>', 'Good composition and heartwarming photo.', '2008-03-27 19:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592286, 661754, 50695, '<td valign="top">I could have been in this same location and no way would I have come up with this photograph. This is simply great photography. The posthumous blue went to a great photograph with a strong connection to the challenge. The red goes to a great photograph with a so-so connection to the challenge. You.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I could have been in this same location and no way would I have come up with this photograph. This is simply great photography. The posthumous blue went to a great photograph with a strong connection to the challenge. The red goes to a great photograph with a so-so connection to the challenge. You. ', '2008-03-27 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4592287, 661899, 50695, '<td valign="top">Just a lovely photo. Nice tones, colors, and good composition.</td>', 'Just a lovely photo. Nice tones, colors, and good composition.', '2008-03-27 19:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
