(4593897, 661654, 89219, '<td valign="top">I really like this set I think the childlike painting effect could have really worked well.  <br/> <br/>Its a shame about the harsh lighting and microphones, which are obviously out of your control.  I think this would have been a great location to stage a shot after the performance where you could position the actors more intimately and get them to put the mics down.  Maybe even get a softer light.  Although this isn''t always practically possible.</td>', 'I really like this set I think the childlike painting effect could have really worked well.   Its a shame about the harsh lighting and microphones, which are obviously out of your control.  I think this would have been a great location to stage a shot after the performance where you could position the actors more intimately and get them to put the mics down.  Maybe even get a softer light.  Although this isn''t always practically possible.', '2008-03-28 15:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4593909, 661572, 89219, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and the title is a pretty good try at squeezing it into this challenge.  For me it just doesn''t fit but its still a great shot.  As a result I can only give it a 5 even though as a stand alone its worth more.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and the title is a pretty good try at squeezing it into this challenge.  For me it just doesn''t fit but its still a great shot.  As a result I can only give it a 5 even though as a stand alone its worth more.', '2008-03-28 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594069, 660725, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect 10 in my book.  I love the expression on both faces.  It just screams "Adorable" and "Girl Stuff".    If I were forced to complain about something, I''d say the skin looks to smoothed... especially the left girl.   They''re both adorable.   Made me smile.</td>', 'This is a perfect 10 in my book.  I love the expression on both faces.  It just screams "Adorable" and "Girl Stuff".    If I were forced to complain about something, I''d say the skin looks to smoothed... especially the left girl.   They''re both adorable.   Made me smile.', '2008-03-28 16:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594072, 662021, 86447, '<td valign="top">While I don''t think this is an exceptional photograph.. .the feeling it portrays bumps up the score quite high.   If the focus were more on her face than on the hand with the ring, it would be better, IMO.  But, as it is... it''s still beautiful, telling image that makes me feel what I think they''re feeling.  Well done.</td>', 'While I don''t think this is an exceptional photograph.. .the feeling it portrays bumps up the score quite high.   If the focus were more on her face than on the hand with the ring, it would be better, IMO.  But, as it is... it''s still beautiful, telling image that makes me feel what I think they''re feeling.  Well done.', '2008-03-28 16:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594077, 661681, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  The tones are lovely.. .the breeze just makes this even better.  I wish he were more ''into'' the kiss with his hand reaching for or touching her.. but I won''t complain about it.  *wink*    It''s really a lovely ''feel good'' image.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  The tones are lovely.. .the breeze just makes this even better.  I wish he were more ''into'' the kiss with his hand reaching for or touching her.. but I won''t complain about it.  *wink*    It''s really a lovely ''feel good'' image.', '2008-03-28 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594078, 662037, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a great feeling of joy this image gives me.  What better compliment is there?   Well done!   The DOF and focus are really good.   And the BW was a good choice, I think, to bring out the feeling.</td>', 'What a great feeling of joy this image gives me.  What better compliment is there?   Well done!   The DOF and focus are really good.   And the BW was a good choice, I think, to bring out the feeling.', '2008-03-28 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594081, 662198, 86447, '<td valign="top">You''re a brave one!   :)   I like the skewed warpedness of this... adds to the whimsy and the fun.  Thanks for making it BW so we don''t see more than we want to.   *grin*</td>', 'You''re a brave one!   :)   I like the skewed warpedness of this... adds to the whimsy and the fun.  Thanks for making it BW so we don''t see more than we want to.   *grin*', '2008-03-28 16:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594082, 661711, 86447, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!  I don''t know how anyone can view this without feeling a hug.<br/> <br/>It''s really lovely.  I like the composition including the child''s hands.  Really makes it for me.</td>', 'How beautiful!  I don''t know how anyone can view this without feeling a hug. It''s really lovely.  I like the composition including the child''s hands.  Really makes it for me.', '2008-03-28 16:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594084, 661390, 86447, '<td valign="top">oh!  I want to be a lovebird for 68 years!  What a beautiful portrait of love.  The softness of the image makes it glow.  It''s just sharp enough.  Well done.</td>', 'oh!  I want to be a lovebird for 68 years!  What a beautiful portrait of love.  The softness of the image makes it glow.  It''s just sharp enough.  Well done.', '2008-03-28 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594087, 661974, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think this is probably a man and woman... but the peeling polish makes it a father and little girl for me.  I like it better this way.  :)   <br/>I like the ''realness'' of it... the dirty fingers and the peeling polish.  That''s life... right there in your image.</td>', 'I think this is probably a man and woman... but the peeling polish makes it a father and little girl for me.  I like it better this way.  :)   I like the ''realness'' of it... the dirty fingers and the peeling polish.  That''s life... right there in your image.', '2008-03-28 16:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594089, 661632, 86447, '<td valign="top">Romance at its finest!  LOL!   I like this... It''s a quirky rendition of an emotion and you brought me right in and made me buy into it.   The lighting is good, too.  Well done.</td>', 'Romance at its finest!  LOL!   I like this... It''s a quirky rendition of an emotion and you brought me right in and made me buy into it.   The lighting is good, too.  Well done.', '2008-03-28 16:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594091, 661577, 86447, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t technically a "great photograph", the emotion of joy is wonderful.  Childhood secrets... well done and well captured.</td>', 'While this isn''t technically a "great photograph", the emotion of joy is wonderful.  Childhood secrets... well done and well captured.', '2008-03-28 16:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594093, 662244, 86447, '<td valign="top">While this is too grainy to be an excellent work of art, the emotion is wonderful.  I can feel the love.  Well done.</td>', 'While this is too grainy to be an excellent work of art, the emotion is wonderful.  I can feel the love.  Well done.', '2008-03-28 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594095, 661346, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I wish there was a tad bit of her mouth, but that''s the only thing I can find to wish for here.  Beautiful lighting.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I wish there was a tad bit of her mouth, but that''s the only thing I can find to wish for here.  Beautiful lighting.  Beautiful.', '2008-03-28 16:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594097, 662120, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper, but this is a wonderful shot of a beautiful time.  You might get lower scores because it''s been done so often... but I never tire of the emotion.</td>', 'Could be sharper, but this is a wonderful shot of a beautiful time.  You might get lower scores because it''s been done so often... but I never tire of the emotion.', '2008-03-28 16:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594105, 660449, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like how the three are intimate and the other two are a bit left out.  I even imagine their expressions are a bit unhappy... although they all look that way a bit.<br/>The colors are pretty, too.</td>', 'I like how the three are intimate and the other two are a bit left out.  I even imagine their expressions are a bit unhappy... although they all look that way a bit.The colors are pretty, too.', '2008-03-28 16:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594106, 662275, 86447, '<td valign="top">A feel good photo.  I like the PP on it, too.</td>', 'A feel good photo.  I like the PP on it, too.', '2008-03-28 16:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594108, 661336, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, but the blue makes it sort of appear that this is a cadaver...</td>', 'Nicely lit, but the blue makes it sort of appear that this is a cadaver...', '2008-03-28 16:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594110, 662258, 86447, '<td valign="top">Intimacy, for sure.  And a lovely group, well photographed and processed.</td>', 'Intimacy, for sure.  And a lovely group, well photographed and processed.', '2008-03-28 16:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594113, 661530, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s not quite sharp enough to make this a perfect nature shot... could use a bit more DOF, but you got their eyes nicely.</td>', 'It''s not quite sharp enough to make this a perfect nature shot... could use a bit more DOF, but you got their eyes nicely.', '2008-03-28 16:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594121, 662215, 86447, '<td valign="top">I might have liked this better without the mirror ...  just for a bit more intimacy.   I would have liked the top of her head and the tips of her fingers to be included.<br/>But it''s a great feeling of intimacy.  Great idea and processing.</td>', 'I might have liked this better without the mirror ...  just for a bit more intimacy.   I would have liked the top of her head and the tips of her fingers to be included.But it''s a great feeling of intimacy.  Great idea and processing.', '2008-03-28 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594124, 662064, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice PP.   And a good feeling... like dancing in the rain.</td>', 'Nice PP.   And a good feeling... like dancing in the rain.', '2008-03-28 16:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594125, 661900, 86447, '<td valign="top">She looks a bit like she''s grimacing, and his face could be sharper... but I like the lighting.</td>', 'She looks a bit like she''s grimacing, and his face could be sharper... but I like the lighting.', '2008-03-28 16:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594127, 661813, 86447, '<td valign="top">A good smiley feeling!   I wish he were as focused as she... but I like the PP and the feeling.</td>', 'A good smiley feeling!   I wish he were as focused as she... but I like the PP and the feeling.', '2008-03-28 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594130, 660059, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the capture... would have liked to see their feet and her tail instead of the brick wall up top, though.</td>', 'I like the capture... would have liked to see their feet and her tail instead of the brick wall up top, though.', '2008-03-28 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594132, 660999, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed.  Might be better with a tad bit more contrast to get more tones?</td>', 'Beautifully composed.  Might be better with a tad bit more contrast to get more tones?', '2008-03-28 16:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594133, 662132, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit too dark to bring me into the photo and feel the feeling you''re trying to get me to feel.  My eye gets caught on the sheet and wants to stay there since it''s so much brighter than their faces.</td>', 'It''s a bit too dark to bring me into the photo and feel the feeling you''re trying to get me to feel.  My eye gets caught on the sheet and wants to stay there since it''s so much brighter than their faces.', '2008-03-28 16:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594136, 661614, 86447, '<td valign="top">Eewwww!   Nasty mouth kisses!  LOL   Nicely captured.  I wish there a bit more detail in the dog''s eye (or a catch light) to make this more ''alive''.</td>', 'Eewwww!   Nasty mouth kisses!  LOL   Nicely captured.  I wish there a bit more detail in the dog''s eye (or a catch light) to make this more ''alive''.', '2008-03-28 16:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594138, 660998, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this ... with all of that white space.   I wish his eyes were open, though.  And having his foot be the closest thing to the camera really makes it look huge.</td>', 'I really like the composition on this ... with all of that white space.   I wish his eyes were open, though.  And having his foot be the closest thing to the camera really makes it look huge.', '2008-03-28 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594142, 661976, 86447, '<td valign="top">Is fighting "intimacy"??  I''ll have to look that one up so won''t consider that in the scoring.  It''s a well-shot image with great tones.  Well PP.  I really like how sharp the antlers are captured.  I wish the guy on the right had some legs to even this up a bit.</td>', 'Is fighting "intimacy"??  I''ll have to look that one up so won''t consider that in the scoring.  It''s a well-shot image with great tones.  Well PP.  I really like how sharp the antlers are captured.  I wish the guy on the right had some legs to even this up a bit.', '2008-03-28 16:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594145, 661728, 86447, '<td valign="top">A bit too harsh lighting to make this perfect... but a great sense of intimacy.</td>', 'A bit too harsh lighting to make this perfect... but a great sense of intimacy.', '2008-03-28 16:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594151, 661866, 86447, '<td valign="top">On the one hand I like how the baby is the most lit here (perfectly) drawing attention to the fact that he/she is the focus of their love.  But, I then want to see the love and their faces are too dark to allow me to do that as well as I like.  But, then again, it may be my monitor.  *sigh* <br/>If Iwere in charge of the wardrobe, I''d have put a long sleeved shirt on the man.</td>', 'On the one hand I like how the baby is the most lit here (perfectly) drawing attention to the fact that he/she is the focus of their love.  But, I then want to see the love and their faces are too dark to allow me to do that as well as I like.  But, then again, it may be my monitor.  *sigh* If Iwere in charge of the wardrobe, I''d have put a long sleeved shirt on the man.', '2008-03-28 16:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594153, 661732, 86447, '<td valign="top">That blue is striking!  And the subjects are nice and sharp and well lit.  Not sure how you think this is intimacy, but I won''t count off for that.<br/>I wonder how this would look upside down...</td>', 'That blue is striking!  And the subjects are nice and sharp and well lit.  Not sure how you think this is intimacy, but I won''t count off for that.I wonder how this would look upside down...', '2008-03-28 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594155, 660994, 86447, '<td valign="top">Her hand being so much more lit than the faces make my eye stop there and I have a hard time moving on to the darker areas of the photo.</td>', 'Her hand being so much more lit than the faces make my eye stop there and I have a hard time moving on to the darker areas of the photo.', '2008-03-28 16:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594157, 662178, 86447, '<td valign="top">Somehow all of this blown stuff enhances the feeling.  I wish Mom''s face were a tad bit sharper though.  A good feeling is what you''ve captured here.</td>', 'Somehow all of this blown stuff enhances the feeling.  I wish Mom''s face were a tad bit sharper though.  A good feeling is what you''ve captured here.', '2008-03-28 16:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594159, 661445, 86447, '<td valign="top">He would appear more sensual with more caressing fingers instead of them being so splayed... and they''re the sharpest thing in the image... so it''s distracting to me.</td>', 'He would appear more sensual with more caressing fingers instead of them being so splayed... and they''re the sharpest thing in the image... so it''s distracting to me.', '2008-03-28 17:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594160, 662253, 86447, '<td valign="top">Her hair being dreamy with that ear peeking out and the background really make the top half of this image a winner.   The lower half doesn''t excite my senses at all.  I think it''s too focused or not as dreamy as the top half...  making it seem almost like two separate photos.</td>', 'Her hair being dreamy with that ear peeking out and the background really make the top half of this image a winner.   The lower half doesn''t excite my senses at all.  I think it''s too focused or not as dreamy as the top half...  making it seem almost like two separate photos.', '2008-03-28 17:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594162, 660345, 86447, '<td valign="top">If his head were tilted to go in for a kiss... and maybe his lips slightly parted, this would have better emotion, I think.  As it is, I''m afraid he''s just going to spit on her.  Sorry.  I can''t get past that feeling.  Her expression is perfect.    But, perhaps this wasn''t staged and you had what they gave you.  With that, you''ve done a good job.</td>', 'If his head were tilted to go in for a kiss... and maybe his lips slightly parted, this would have better emotion, I think.  As it is, I''m afraid he''s just going to spit on her.  Sorry.  I can''t get past that feeling.  Her expression is perfect.    But, perhaps this wasn''t staged and you had what they gave you.  With that, you''ve done a good job.', '2008-03-28 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594164, 662209, 86447, '<td valign="top">The tattoos being so much lighter and closer to the camera distract me from their perfectly intimate faces.</td>', 'The tattoos being so much lighter and closer to the camera distract me from their perfectly intimate faces.', '2008-03-28 17:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594165, 661966, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this... It just doesn''t seem sharp enough to me. The colors are fun.</td>', 'I like the idea of this... It just doesn''t seem sharp enough to me. The colors are fun.', '2008-03-28 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594213, 661366, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting on this pair.  I wish the bunny''s nose was a tad bit lighter, but it''s a beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting on this pair.  I wish the bunny''s nose was a tad bit lighter, but it''s a beautiful image.', '2008-03-28 17:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594216, 661754, 86447, '<td valign="top">This could use some more contrast or something to have more tones.   I would also like to see the heads of the two on the crosses a bit better, for this to have more of an impact.</td>', 'This could use some more contrast or something to have more tones.   I would also like to see the heads of the two on the crosses a bit better, for this to have more of an impact.', '2008-03-28 17:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594217, 662154, 86447, '<td valign="top">If the lighting were a bit more on where the bodies join it would make this seem less like one single body.   Good job on the processing.</td>', 'If the lighting were a bit more on where the bodies join it would make this seem less like one single body.   Good job on the processing.', '2008-03-28 17:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594220, 661828, 86447, '<td valign="top">It looks like the boy''s mouth is tied shut.  *smile*   I like the lighting, but could be a smidge more on the girl''s face to really emphasize them both.    They''re adorable!</td>', 'It looks like the boy''s mouth is tied shut.  *smile*   I like the lighting, but could be a smidge more on the girl''s face to really emphasize them both.    They''re adorable!', '2008-03-28 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594222, 661944, 86447, '<td valign="top">A good image... but the position of the first climber doesn''t really work for making me struggle with him.  I need to see his head or his left arm, I think.  Perhaps a snap a second or two earlier or later would have more impact?<br/> <br/>The composition is wonderful for drawing me through and the rope aids in that even more.</td>', 'A good image... but the position of the first climber doesn''t really work for making me struggle with him.  I need to see his head or his left arm, I think.  Perhaps a snap a second or two earlier or later would have more impact? The composition is wonderful for drawing me through and the rope aids in that even more.', '2008-03-28 17:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594224, 661576, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish we could see all of their heads... and their faces were as lightly lit as the guitar.  As it is, my eye goes right to the guitar and I have to pull it away to try to explore the rest of the image.   Good feeling photo... just would benefit with better lighting and composition, I think.</td>', 'I wish we could see all of their heads... and their faces were as lightly lit as the guitar.  As it is, my eye goes right to the guitar and I have to pull it away to try to explore the rest of the image.   Good feeling photo... just would benefit with better lighting and composition, I think.', '2008-03-28 17:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594226, 659803, 86447, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting angles and lighting, but touching one''s own knee does not evoke any emotion in me... so the image leaves me feeling like she''s got an itch or something.  I''m sorry.</td>', 'It''s interesting angles and lighting, but touching one''s own knee does not evoke any emotion in me... so the image leaves me feeling like she''s got an itch or something.  I''m sorry.', '2008-03-28 17:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594229, 661305, 86447, '<td valign="top">With the one on the left''s ears back, it makes me think a fights gonna break out... not a scene of intimacy.  But, I''ll not fault you for that.  I like the blown highlights... but wish I could see more of their legs instead of the blank sky.</td>', 'With the one on the left''s ears back, it makes me think a fights gonna break out... not a scene of intimacy.  But, I''ll not fault you for that.  I like the blown highlights... but wish I could see more of their legs instead of the blank sky.', '2008-03-28 17:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594230, 660996, 86447, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit flat to me... more contrast or better lighting might help.</td>', 'This seems a bit flat to me... more contrast or better lighting might help.', '2008-03-28 17:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594232, 661247, 86447, '<td valign="top">I would never have thought that chairs could display intimacy, but you''ve done it here.  A fun capture and good lines and colors.</td>', 'I would never have thought that chairs could display intimacy, but you''ve done it here.  A fun capture and good lines and colors.', '2008-03-28 17:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594235, 661808, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this is ''intimacy''... but it''s an interesting shot, anyway.  Could be better focus on the red things (marbles?), I think, to make this better.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this is ''intimacy''... but it''s an interesting shot, anyway.  Could be better focus on the red things (marbles?), I think, to make this better.', '2008-03-28 17:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594236, 660060, 86447, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... until I get to the tummy that''s cut off.  It''s all about the pregnancy, so all of the tummy should be there to get the feeling portrayed, IMO.  A beautiful time, though.</td>', 'Beautiful... until I get to the tummy that''s cut off.  It''s all about the pregnancy, so all of the tummy should be there to get the feeling portrayed, IMO.  A beautiful time, though.', '2008-03-28 17:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594238, 661000, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the girl''s eye.. and the dog looks like we''ve interrupted him/her in something and he/she''s annoyed.    I like the feeling of love the girl is giving to us, though.</td>', 'I wish I could see the girl''s eye.. and the dog looks like we''ve interrupted him/her in something and he/she''s annoyed.    I like the feeling of love the girl is giving to us, though.', '2008-03-28 17:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594242, 660679, 85572, '<td valign="top">a little distracting the background</td>', 'a little distracting the background', '2008-03-28 17:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4594243, 661754, 85572, '<td valign="top">interesting aproach</td>', 'interesting aproach', '2008-03-28 17:52:41.000000', NULL, 1);
