(4594808, 660999, 90947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful couple.  Lighting is great.  I like the low key feel for this image as it feels like the couple is reluctantly ending a new love.  She has a sort of fatalistic look about her.</td>', 'Beautiful couple.  Lighting is great.  I like the low key feel for this image as it feels like the couple is reluctantly ending a new love.  She has a sort of fatalistic look about her.', '2008-03-29 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
