(4595198, 661445, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, imo it seems to be a bit over exposed &amp; the tonality seems a bit off. Possibly do to the over exposeure.</td>', 'Nice image, imo it seems to be a bit over exposed & the tonality seems a bit off. Possibly do to the over exposeure.', '2008-03-29 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
