(4595203, 660066, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Looks like you took this thro glass shower door which kind of disorted the image a bit esp the fingers.</td>', 'Nicely done. Looks like you took this thro glass shower door which kind of disorted the image a bit esp the fingers.', '2008-03-29 10:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
