(4595260, 661530, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2008-03-29 10:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595265, 661685, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The wind thingies there are a bit of a distraction they just kept drawing my eye.</td>', 'Nicely done. The wind thingies there are a bit of a distraction they just kept drawing my eye.', '2008-03-29 10:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595267, 661247, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the tho comes accross but doesn''t quite get there.</td>', 'Nice image, the tho comes accross but doesn''t quite get there.', '2008-03-29 10:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595331, 661652, 60047, '<td valign="top">This works. Nice job.</td>', 'This works. Nice job.', '2008-03-29 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595344, 661828, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like this composition. I think slightly less extremes on the shadows and highlights might warm this up a bit. You may have put the girl on the right in soft focus on purpose, but I wonder if a greater DOF in order to get both models in crisp focus would work even better?</td>', 'I like this composition. I think slightly less extremes on the shadows and highlights might warm this up a bit. You may have put the girl on the right in soft focus on purpose, but I wonder if a greater DOF in order to get both models in crisp focus would work even better?', '2008-03-29 11:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595359, 661614, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love pets. I''ve had dogs and cats all my life. This is a great shot for the challenge. There is a bit of me, however, that would prefer to see the dog tongue just a little farther away from the mouth of the model! Nice use of soft focus, here (or shallow DOF).</td>', 'I love pets. I''ve had dogs and cats all my life. This is a great shot for the challenge. There is a bit of me, however, that would prefer to see the dog tongue just a little farther away from the mouth of the model! Nice use of soft focus, here (or shallow DOF).', '2008-03-29 11:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595364, 660463, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a neat B&amp;W. Trying to figure out how it fits with "Intimacy" though. I must be missing something.</td>', 'This is a neat B&W. Trying to figure out how it fits with "Intimacy" though. I must be missing something.', '2008-03-29 11:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595373, 662253, 60047, '<td valign="top">Without the title I might not have immediately realized the hand belonged to someone other than the model. Perhaps her had on top of his would have made this clearer? Nice concept for the challenge.</td>', 'Without the title I might not have immediately realized the hand belonged to someone other than the model. Perhaps her had on top of his would have made this clearer? Nice concept for the challenge.', '2008-03-29 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595375, 661132, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really like the art... not sure about the photo, though...   Sorry.  Seems scary to me.</td>', 'I really like the art... not sure about the photo, though...   Sorry.  Seems scary to me.', '2008-03-29 11:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595378, 660987, 86447, '<td valign="top">The lighting and white space here are good.  It seems a bit flat, though...  and doesn''t seem to portray ''intimacy'' to me (but no points off for that since I might not ''get it''.  *Grin* )</td>', 'The lighting and white space here are good.  It seems a bit flat, though...  and doesn''t seem to portray ''intimacy'' to me (but no points off for that since I might not ''get it''.  *Grin* )', '2008-03-29 11:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595382, 662082, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a great perspective... the composition could be improved, in my opinion, to give her more space on the left of the photo.</td>', 'This is a great perspective... the composition could be improved, in my opinion, to give her more space on the left of the photo.', '2008-03-29 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595385, 660287, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this... but something just doesn''t click in it for me.  Perhaps it''s the shirt and the background running together.  I don''t know...  Or maybe it''s that her eyes don''t have enough light.</td>', 'I like the idea of this... but something just doesn''t click in it for me.  Perhaps it''s the shirt and the background running together.  I don''t know...  Or maybe it''s that her eyes don''t have enough light.', '2008-03-29 11:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595388, 660066, 86447, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t give me an ''intimacy'' feel (but no points off for a bad title)...  the crop is a bit tight.  Her hands look unnatural... like they''re claws or something.  Sorry.</td>', 'The title doesn''t give me an ''intimacy'' feel (but no points off for a bad title)...  the crop is a bit tight.  Her hands look unnatural... like they''re claws or something.  Sorry.', '2008-03-29 11:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595390, 661187, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like how they''re in their ''own little world''... and the child in the background makes that even more so.  I think it could be a bit sharper focus on the child to make this better... and maybe a bit brighter and richer.</td>', 'I like how they''re in their ''own little world''... and the child in the background makes that even more so.  I think it could be a bit sharper focus on the child to make this better... and maybe a bit brighter and richer.', '2008-03-29 11:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595395, 659875, 60047, '<td valign="top">The nudity between the two models certainly makes the statement that they are a close couple. The fact that they are facing the same direction and up takes away from the idea of intimacy for me. I would prefer them either facing each other or perhaps a closer embrace with the head of the one in the rear closer to the head or on the shoulder of the model in the front. You have guts for doing this nude!</td>', 'The nudity between the two models certainly makes the statement that they are a close couple. The fact that they are facing the same direction and up takes away from the idea of intimacy for me. I would prefer them either facing each other or perhaps a closer embrace with the head of the one in the rear closer to the head or on the shoulder of the model in the front. You have guts for doing this nude!', '2008-03-29 11:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595396, 662241, 86447, '<td valign="top">His fist looks clutched instead of caressing... which makes me think this is not so much ''intimacy'' but ''threatening''.   (no points off for that, though)<br/> <br/>I wish I could see his mouth... perhaps that would help me with the feelings.</td>', 'His fist looks clutched instead of caressing... which makes me think this is not so much ''intimacy'' but ''threatening''.   (no points off for that, though) I wish I could see his mouth... perhaps that would help me with the feelings.', '2008-03-29 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595398, 662146, 86447, '<td valign="top">I would have liked for the hand to be less in focus, I think... to make this something more dreamy... like the other hand maybe...</td>', 'I would have liked for the hand to be less in focus, I think... to make this something more dreamy... like the other hand maybe...', '2008-03-29 11:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595403, 661572, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this has to do with ''intimacy''... it seems like you took a pretty photo and wanted to make it fit into the challenge with a title.  It''s definitely a pretty photo.</td>', 'Not sure what this has to do with ''intimacy''... it seems like you took a pretty photo and wanted to make it fit into the challenge with a title.  It''s definitely a pretty photo.', '2008-03-29 11:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595406, 661685, 86447, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tighter crop and taken from a lower vantage point would have brought us into the ''intimacy'' a bit more.</td>', 'Perhaps a tighter crop and taken from a lower vantage point would have brought us into the ''intimacy'' a bit more.', '2008-03-29 11:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595408, 662088, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very intimate.  Might be better with a tad bit more light... or brightness.</td>', 'Very intimate.  Might be better with a tad bit more light... or brightness.', '2008-03-29 11:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595409, 660916, 60047, '<td valign="top">Copulation between bugs actually doesn''t stress "Intimacy" to me. That said, this photo is quite beautiful due to the flower''s color and structure.</td>', 'Copulation between bugs actually doesn''t stress "Intimacy" to me. That said, this photo is quite beautiful due to the flower''s color and structure.', '2008-03-29 11:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595410, 662219, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nasty!  Eww!   *grin*   Good capture... but seems a bit too tightly cropped to be really pleasing.</td>', 'Nasty!  Eww!   *grin*   Good capture... but seems a bit too tightly cropped to be really pleasing.', '2008-03-29 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595413, 661439, 86447, '<td valign="top">Seems like the subjects are too dark and not really well posed... with only one head for the lot of them.   *smile*</td>', 'Seems like the subjects are too dark and not really well posed... with only one head for the lot of them.   *smile*', '2008-03-29 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595415, 661928, 86447, '<td valign="top">Pretty... but seems so contrived. I don''t know...  Something just doesn''t work for me in it.  I do like the splash of red and of blue.</td>', 'Pretty... but seems so contrived. I don''t know...  Something just doesn''t work for me in it.  I do like the splash of red and of blue.', '2008-03-29 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595418, 661530, 60047, '<td valign="top">Bugs copulating doesn''t really evoke the idea of "Intimacy" for me. With that being said, this is a pretty cool macro shot of two flies. I wish the focus and DOF was able to capture the flies more crisply.</td>', 'Bugs copulating doesn''t really evoke the idea of "Intimacy" for me. With that being said, this is a pretty cool macro shot of two flies. I wish the focus and DOF was able to capture the flies more crisply.', '2008-03-29 11:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595420, 661652, 86447, '<td valign="top">Great composition except perhaps a tad bit more on the lower edge would make this better.  I like the ''no faces'' take and still portraying intimacy.</td>', 'Great composition except perhaps a tad bit more on the lower edge would make this better.  I like the ''no faces'' take and still portraying intimacy.', '2008-03-29 11:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595422, 661765, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a timely capture... I''d like a bit more detail in the blacks, but that''s hard to do, I know.</td>', 'This is a timely capture... I''d like a bit more detail in the blacks, but that''s hard to do, I know.', '2008-03-29 11:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595424, 661966, 60047, '<td valign="top">Now that''s clever and funny!</td>', 'Now that''s clever and funny!', '2008-03-29 11:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595426, 662246, 86447, '<td valign="top">If this were more in focus and less DOF, I''d call this a winner.  Nicely composed.  Showing just enough to get the feeling across.</td>', 'If this were more in focus and less DOF, I''d call this a winner.  Nicely composed.  Showing just enough to get the feeling across.', '2008-03-29 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595428, 661769, 86447, '<td valign="top">The focus could be sharper on the spider, I think... and it seems a bit flat colorwise.</td>', 'The focus could be sharper on the spider, I think... and it seems a bit flat colorwise.', '2008-03-29 11:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595429, 661445, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is a great high key B &amp; W. After a longer look, I would have preferred the guy to look more like he''s kissing. It almost looks like he could be biting her neck. A little more pursing of the lips would do it.</td>', 'This is a great high key B & W. After a longer look, I would have preferred the guy to look more like he''s kissing. It almost looks like he could be biting her neck. A little more pursing of the lips would do it.', '2008-03-29 11:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595430, 661200, 86447, '<td valign="top">The motion is good here.</td>', 'The motion is good here.', '2008-03-29 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595433, 660987, 60047, '<td valign="top">A great B &amp; W. I''m missing the "Intimacy" part, though.</td>', 'A great B & W. I''m missing the "Intimacy" part, though.', '2008-03-29 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595434, 661341, 86447, '<td valign="top">The flash doesn''t work for me... and the angle is too low to be a really pleasing photo... but the memory was captured and treasured, I''m sure.</td>', 'The flash doesn''t work for me... and the angle is too low to be a really pleasing photo... but the memory was captured and treasured, I''m sure.', '2008-03-29 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595436, 660575, 86447, '<td valign="top">I need to see more of the bear''s head, I think to make this better.  Fun idea.</td>', 'I need to see more of the bear''s head, I think to make this better.  Fun idea.', '2008-03-29 11:54:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4595437, 660596, 86447, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful.  I wish this were lighter so I could see her better.</td>', 'She''s beautiful.  I wish this were lighter so I could see her better.', '2008-03-29 11:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595439, 661852, 86447, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t work for me very well... And the focus seems to be poor on his face.  I''m glad he''s worshiping, though.   :)</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t work for me very well... And the focus seems to be poor on his face.  I''m glad he''s worshiping, though.   :)', '2008-03-29 11:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595443, 661651, 86447, '<td valign="top">The eyes need a catchlight in them to be more life-like.  It seems really flat without them.</td>', 'The eyes need a catchlight in them to be more life-like.  It seems really flat without them.', '2008-03-29 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595444, 660969, 86447, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh, I fear, to make this a really good image.  The colors are washed out.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh, I fear, to make this a really good image.  The colors are washed out.', '2008-03-29 11:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595446, 661565, 60047, '<td valign="top">The intimacy is there. But the busy background and harsh lighting take away from the concept and move the photo into more of the feel of a snapshot. Put a solid color sheet in front of the furniture behind the the models and I''d bet the photo would be a stunner!</td>', 'The intimacy is there. But the busy background and harsh lighting take away from the concept and move the photo into more of the feel of a snapshot. Put a solid color sheet in front of the furniture behind the the models and I''d bet the photo would be a stunner!', '2008-03-29 11:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595448, 661729, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful feeling of intimacy on the child''s part... the mom is still working and so seems disinterested.  I''ve read once that one should not crop right at a body joint (elbow) as it is not as pleasing as cropping mid limb.  I think that advice would have helped here.</td>', 'What a beautiful feeling of intimacy on the child''s part... the mom is still working and so seems disinterested.  I''ve read once that one should not crop right at a body joint (elbow) as it is not as pleasing as cropping mid limb.  I think that advice would have helped here.', '2008-03-29 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595449, 660912, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could be brighter, I think... but well focused.  And the bokeh is pleasing.</td>', 'Could be brighter, I think... but well focused.  And the bokeh is pleasing.', '2008-03-29 11:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595450, 662107, 86447, '<td valign="top">The dirty/polish fingernail distracts me from the image.  And the red tone is not pleasing to me.</td>', 'The dirty/polish fingernail distracts me from the image.  And the red tone is not pleasing to me.', '2008-03-29 11:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
