(4595484, 661654, 86447, '<td valign="top">The lighting is poor here... I know it''s a stage and has to be brightly lit, but the guy''s shadow is distracting.  It also could be better focused.</td>', 'The lighting is poor here... I know it''s a stage and has to be brightly lit, but the guy''s shadow is distracting.  It also could be better focused.', '2008-03-29 12:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
