(4595499, 660995, 86447, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is bad... and cropping off the top half of a subject''s face is usually frowned upon.  It''s a pity, too... since the scene was a beautiful moment, I''m sure.</td>', 'The focus on this is bad... and cropping off the top half of a subject''s face is usually frowned upon.  It''s a pity, too... since the scene was a beautiful moment, I''m sure.', '2008-03-29 12:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
