(4595717, 660994, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The bare skin, the girl''s arms wrapped around her man, the look in her eyes, all of these show an intimate connection.  His expression, looking down, works well as it connotes a certain expectation.  <br/> <br/>Lovely colors.  The light is a little hot on the girl''s forearm, but forgivable.  Well done.<br/> <br/>Coming back for a 2nd look.  This is my favorite for the challenge.  Bumping to a 10.</td>', 'Lovely.  The bare skin, the girl''s arms wrapped around her man, the look in her eyes, all of these show an intimate connection.  His expression, looking down, works well as it connotes a certain expectation.   Lovely colors.  The light is a little hot on the girl''s forearm, but forgivable.  Well done. Coming back for a 2nd look.  This is my favorite for the challenge.  Bumping to a 10.', '2008-03-29 16:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595718, 662120, 19982, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.  I like the hand placements, the negative space, the B&amp;W toning.  Well done.</td>', 'Good lighting.  I like the hand placements, the negative space, the B&W toning.  Well done.', '2008-03-29 16:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595719, 660449, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  Very emotive.  Sends the message of intimacy through loud and clear.  Love it!</td>', 'Beautiful image.  Very emotive.  Sends the message of intimacy through loud and clear.  Love it!', '2008-03-29 16:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595720, 661632, 19982, '<td valign="top">Now this is what I consider "out of the box" and yet 100% right on target.  I "get it".  And I get it without the title.  But the title just makes me smile.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Now this is what I consider "out of the box" and yet 100% right on target.  I "get it".  And I get it without the title.  But the title just makes me smile.  Nicely done!', '2008-03-29 16:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4595721, 661711, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2008-03-29 16:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
