(4595779, 662082, 68586, '<td valign="top">I quite like this -  but the crop near her head is too close, and I''m undecided about the grain.</td>', 'I quite like this -  but the crop near her head is too close, and I''m undecided about the grain.', '2008-03-29 17:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
