(4595790, 660679, 68586, '<td valign="top">''The She We Don''t See''  - that''s because there''s a towel in the way . . oh wait - I see what you mean . .   :- )<br/> <br/>A good idea but there are too many strong verticals in here which detract from the picture, and there is a distracting tension between the whiteness of the basin drawing the eye away from the model, along with the large dark area diagonally opposite it.<br/> <br/>Ideally you would have moved her along the mirror a little to get ris of the dark area, and hung a backdrop behind her to lose the distracting reflections in the mirror. Perhaps also gone for a towel with a punchier colour ?<br/> <br/>It''s a good idea, and a fits the challenge well, but for me, needs more work on the technicals. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '''The She We Don''t See''  - that''s because there''s a towel in the way . . oh wait - I see what you mean . .   :- ) A good idea but there are too many strong verticals in here which detract from the picture, and there is a distracting tension between the whiteness of the basin drawing the eye away from the model, along with the large dark area diagonally opposite it. Ideally you would have moved her along the mirror a little to get ris of the dark area, and hung a backdrop behind her to lose the distracting reflections in the mirror. Perhaps also gone for a towel with a punchier colour ? It''s a good idea, and a fits the challenge well, but for me, needs more work on the technicals. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-03-29 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
