(4596068, 661899, 60047, '<td valign="top">The furniture coming in at the top right along with the cropping off of the ear and paws moves this shot into the realm of snapshot for me. I think the concept of this photo is ideal - I just wish it was more composed for the purpose of  photography.</td>', 'The furniture coming in at the top right along with the cropping off of the ear and paws moves this shot into the realm of snapshot for me. I think the concept of this photo is ideal - I just wish it was more composed for the purpose of  photography.', '2008-03-29 21:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
