(4598020, 661932, 12661, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, but the fact that the bar code is front and center is really a major distraction. To me, nothing screams ''not intimate'' more than a bar code. Also, the white balance seems to be a bit too much on the warm side.</td>', 'The idea is nice, but the fact that the bar code is front and center is really a major distraction. To me, nothing screams ''not intimate'' more than a bar code. Also, the white balance seems to be a bit too much on the warm side.', '2008-03-31 03:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598022, 660078, 12661, '<td valign="top">A stretch of the theme, but who cares. Photo wise, I like the tilt as it ties in nicely with eating out of a fast food bag (being in a rush and all). The only caution I would give is to be cautious about every aspect of your composition. In this photo, the food appears to be coming out of his nose. It may be subtle, but it can have a very negative impact on a photo.</td>', 'A stretch of the theme, but who cares. Photo wise, I like the tilt as it ties in nicely with eating out of a fast food bag (being in a rush and all). The only caution I would give is to be cautious about every aspect of your composition. In this photo, the food appears to be coming out of his nose. It may be subtle, but it can have a very negative impact on a photo.', '2008-03-31 03:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598024, 660284, 12661, '<td valign="top">Eyes!!! To truly show intimacy, you need to let the viewer see the subjects eyes for that is where intimacy resides.</td>', 'Eyes!!! To truly show intimacy, you need to let the viewer see the subjects eyes for that is where intimacy resides.', '2008-03-31 03:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598026, 662219, 12661, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I would have gone B&amp;W with this shot. The tongue is to close in shade to the cheek and doesn''t stand out as much as I would have liked. Leaving the color in the photo may have provided better contrast.</td>', 'I don''t know if I would have gone B&W with this shot. The tongue is to close in shade to the cheek and doesn''t stand out as much as I would have liked. Leaving the color in the photo may have provided better contrast.', '2008-03-31 03:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598033, 660449, 12661, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely composed and has a great sense of intimacy. If those other two monkeys on the left moved on, it would have been better. But I would bet that you already knew that.</td>', 'This is very nicely composed and has a great sense of intimacy. If those other two monkeys on the left moved on, it would have been better. But I would bet that you already knew that.', '2008-03-31 03:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598037, 661928, 12661, '<td valign="top">As a whole, the photograph is very appealing. I like the expression and the mood is certainly intimate. My only criticisms, if I may, are: the overexposure on the right back of the model draws away the viewers attention and the two fingers of the left hand peeking up from the crop are distracting. As a side note, a red bra could have driven the message home a bit more.</td>', 'As a whole, the photograph is very appealing. I like the expression and the mood is certainly intimate. My only criticisms, if I may, are: the overexposure on the right back of the model draws away the viewers attention and the two fingers of the left hand peeking up from the crop are distracting. As a side note, a red bra could have driven the message home a bit more.', '2008-03-31 03:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598044, 660131, 12661, '<td valign="top">The sharp change in lighting is distracting. Ideally, all the subjects should have been in the shade and any sunlight areas should be cropped out. Pictures taken in bright overhead sun rarely come out exposed properly.</td>', 'The sharp change in lighting is distracting. Ideally, all the subjects should have been in the shade and any sunlight areas should be cropped out. Pictures taken in bright overhead sun rarely come out exposed properly.', '2008-03-31 03:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598046, 660757, 12661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and excellent composition. Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and excellent composition. Very well done.', '2008-03-31 03:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598051, 661439, 12661, '<td valign="top">I would have done away with the plastic beach chairs as the don''t add to the image, are distracting, and give the photo a snapshot feel.</td>', 'I would have done away with the plastic beach chairs as the don''t add to the image, are distracting, and give the photo a snapshot feel.', '2008-03-31 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598057, 662120, 12661, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice use of negative space, nice lighting, nice skin texture, etc, etc, etc.<br/> <br/>Sorry, I got nothing negative to say.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice use of negative space, nice lighting, nice skin texture, etc, etc, etc. Sorry, I got nothing negative to say.', '2008-03-31 03:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598059, 662132, 12661, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the eye contact between the mother and daughter to establish a deeper sense of intimacy. Aside from that, the lighting is spot on.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the eye contact between the mother and daughter to establish a deeper sense of intimacy. Aside from that, the lighting is spot on.', '2008-03-31 03:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598060, 660998, 12661, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well for this photo. However, be careful about lens distortion when composing. In this image, the man''s foot appears twice as large as his head and really pulls the attention away from the subject''s faces. Back up and zoom in to prevent that.</td>', 'The soft focus works well for this photo. However, be careful about lens distortion when composing. In this image, the man''s foot appears twice as large as his head and really pulls the attention away from the subject''s faces. Back up and zoom in to prevent that.', '2008-03-31 03:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598062, 661709, 12661, '<td valign="top">The white balance in this photo is way off and the graininess is very distracting. I obviously don''t know what camera you are using, but check the manual to see if you can adjust the white balance setting. Typically, there is a setting for indoor lighting (sometimes called tungsten or represented by a light bulb symbol). In that setting, you will get much more natural colors.</td>', 'The white balance in this photo is way off and the graininess is very distracting. I obviously don''t know what camera you are using, but check the manual to see if you can adjust the white balance setting. Typically, there is a setting for indoor lighting (sometimes called tungsten or represented by a light bulb symbol). In that setting, you will get much more natural colors.', '2008-03-31 03:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598076, 661530, 12661, '<td valign="top">I finally bought myself a macro lens last week and thought to myself that it would help me much in the intimacy challenge. Well.... you just proved me wrong!!! Bravo. This is hilarious. You pulled it off perfectly.</td>', 'I finally bought myself a macro lens last week and thought to myself that it would help me much in the intimacy challenge. Well.... you just proved me wrong!!! Bravo. This is hilarious. You pulled it off perfectly.', '2008-03-31 03:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598081, 661390, 12661, '<td valign="top">The message is strong, but the composition doesn''t do it justice. The angled frame with the corner behind the man''s head and the plant between his legs (hiding the cast?) are very distracting. Perhaps if the couple was centered underneath the picture frame, the position were swapped so that the cast was behind his wife, and the plant was either removed or well off to one side the image would have been stronger.</td>', 'The message is strong, but the composition doesn''t do it justice. The angled frame with the corner behind the man''s head and the plant between his legs (hiding the cast?) are very distracting. Perhaps if the couple was centered underneath the picture frame, the position were swapped so that the cast was behind his wife, and the plant was either removed or well off to one side the image would have been stronger.', '2008-03-31 04:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4598201, 662258, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, wonderful expressions, nice composition. I love it. The range of expressions is fantastic. The older girl''s smile lights up the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful tones, wonderful expressions, nice composition. I love it. The range of expressions is fantastic. The older girl''s smile lights up the picture.', '2008-03-31 07:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
