(4605590, 661709, 89637, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the advice.. however I do actually understand white balance.  It''s clear I don''t understand how to please ppl though.  I purposely tricked the white balance in this shot and used a warm up filter on my flash and I add the grain post-production.  I just like the old twee look it gave.  I have no excuse for the flash mark<br/> <br/>... I''ll stick to b&amp;w next time!</td>', 'Thanks for all the advice.. however I do actually understand white balance.  It''s clear I don''t understand how to please ppl though.  I purposely tricked the white balance in this shot and used a warm up filter on my flash and I add the grain post-production.  I just like the old twee look it gave.  I have no excuse for the flash mark ... I''ll stick to b&w next time!', '2008-04-02 06:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
