(4606720, 660596, 54563, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments and favs everyone.. I didn''t think about it but being new here I guess I should have realized no one knows I can actually choose how I want to expose a portrait lol.<br/> <br/>This is my son and I have a zillion beautiful bright rosey cheek sharp pics of him (and some not so sharp and bright I suppose :) ) but wanted something more dark and intimate.. then there was this challenge and I thought it fit rather well.  I actually did most of the work in camera just desaturated in lightroom a few other tweaks and made sure that there was no vignetting allowed here so left that off, it turned out it was better without the vignette I''m prone to anyhow.</td>', 'thanks for the comments and favs everyone.. I didn''t think about it but being new here I guess I should have realized no one knows I can actually choose how I want to expose a portrait lol. This is my son and I have a zillion beautiful bright rosey cheek sharp pics of him (and some not so sharp and bright I suppose :) ) but wanted something more dark and intimate.. then there was this challenge and I thought it fit rather well.  I actually did most of the work in camera just desaturated in lightroom a few other tweaks and made sure that there was no vignetting allowed here so left that off, it turned out it was better without the vignette I''m prone to anyhow.', '2008-04-02 12:33:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606885, 661681, 31133, '<td valign="top">yay ... Yay ... YAY!!!! Big congrats to you Lisa! I''m sooo happy for you with the ribbon and a blue one to boot. It''s well-deserved, a wonderful image! Hope you tell the bride and groom that they got a blue ribbon. Bet they''ll be thrilled too!</td>', 'yay ... Yay ... YAY!!!! Big congrats to you Lisa! I''m sooo happy for you with the ribbon and a blue one to boot. It''s well-deserved, a wonderful image! Hope you tell the bride and groom that they got a blue ribbon. Bet they''ll be thrilled too!', '2008-04-02 13:15:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4606915, 660066, 91333, '<td valign="top">Oh well, it was my first try.  I guess what i learnt is that if you are going to try and stretch the topic then you really need to come up with a more fitting title.  I didn''t think that the picture was disturbing, it was supposed to be a look at one girls intimate thoughts - which as far as im aware don''t have to be sexual.<br/>I do agree with the grainy pixelated comments and i want to try and work on this.  I guess it just takes practice</td>', 'Oh well, it was my first try.  I guess what i learnt is that if you are going to try and stretch the topic then you really need to come up with a more fitting title.  I didn''t think that the picture was disturbing, it was supposed to be a look at one girls intimate thoughts - which as far as im aware don''t have to be sexual.I do agree with the grainy pixelated comments and i want to try and work on this.  I guess it just takes practice', '2008-04-02 13:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
