(4613362, 662154, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I think this is beautiful Ragga!   I love that the heads are cropped off because it makes the intimacy the subject.   If you could see their heads -- it would be a portrait type photo of THEM.   This photo is about the beautiful physical intimacy between people who are in love.  I think you did a great job -- and I''m disappointed in the voters for not rating this higher.  (Geee. . .wish I had a dollar for every time I''d been disappointed in the voters :)   I''d be rich.)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, I think this is beautiful Ragga!   I love that the heads are cropped off because it makes the intimacy the subject.   If you could see their heads -- it would be a portrait type photo of THEM.   This photo is about the beautiful physical intimacy between people who are in love.  I think you did a great job -- and I''m disappointed in the voters for not rating this higher.  (Geee. . .wish I had a dollar for every time I''d been disappointed in the voters :)   I''d be rich.) ', '2008-04-04 10:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
