(4615140, 662165, 68035, '<td valign="top">What a great picture and I am stunned it scored so low (especially when I see some of the ones that beat it)<br/> <br/>You have pulled off a great trick here, not only about the moment in time that you have caught which is priceless, but also by the fact that you have combined a really strong sharpness in the shot (look at the mothers tongue) whilst still keeping the softness of the fur (especially on the kitten which I just want to reach out and touch)<br/> <br/>Wonderful</td>', 'What a great picture and I am stunned it scored so low (especially when I see some of the ones that beat it) You have pulled off a great trick here, not only about the moment in time that you have caught which is priceless, but also by the fact that you have combined a really strong sharpness in the shot (look at the mothers tongue) whilst still keeping the softness of the fur (especially on the kitten which I just want to reach out and touch) Wonderful', '2008-04-05 03:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
