(4630808, 660449, 92414, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture indeed :-) Congrats!!!</td>', 'Very cool picture indeed :-) Congrats!!!', '2008-04-10 17:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4634109, 661346, 60495, '<td valign="top">Tom I really liked this one when I voted, I gave it an 8 and looking back at it I like it even more. Nicely done.</td>', 'Tom I really liked this one when I voted, I gave it an 8 and looking back at it I like it even more. Nicely done.', '2008-04-11 22:11:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4634193, 662174, 72316, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-04-12 12:30:34.</i></td>', 'Nice shot.', '2008-04-11 23:03:54.000000', '2008-04-12 13:30:34.000000', 0),
(4645584, 662240, 35545, '<td valign="top">I''m in the minority.  That hand doesn''t bother me at all.  To me, it adds to the shot -- it''s a casual, spur of the moment kiss.  I really like the shot.</td>', 'I''m in the minority.  That hand doesn''t bother me at all.  To me, it adds to the shot -- it''s a casual, spur of the moment kiss.  I really like the shot.', '2008-04-17 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4664856, 662209, 87808, '<td valign="top">I think that the darkness of this shot, lends itself so very well to what you are conveying.  You did a great job on this shot</td>', 'I think that the darkness of this shot, lends itself so very well to what you are conveying.  You did a great job on this shot', '2008-04-29 11:57:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4669001, 662174, 92128, '<td valign="top">There is an umbrella in this shot?</td>', 'There is an umbrella in this shot?', '2008-04-30 19:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4676923, 662240, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Germaine:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m in the minority.  That hand doesn''t bother me at all.  To me, it adds to the shot -- it''s a casual, spur of the moment kiss...</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Agreed. I think it adds to the relaxed and spontaeous feel of it. She''s showing great emotion; he''s playing it cool. Great choice of background too -- adds to the story.</td>', 'Originally posted by Germaine: I''m in the minority.  That hand doesn''t bother me at all.  To me, it adds to the shot -- it''s a casual, spur of the moment kiss...  Agreed. I think it adds to the relaxed and spontaeous feel of it. She''s showing great emotion; he''s playing it cool. Great choice of background too -- adds to the story.', '2008-05-03 10:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4690827, 661132, 62357, '<td valign="top">You know, I can''t help thinking this would have scored higher if the challenge was in Nov/Dec/Jan.  It''s out of season and honestly speaking I''m sure subconsciously that affects the score.  It would have affected my score, had I voted in this one. I like the picture, but I''m not entirely sure it portrays intimacy.</td>', 'You know, I can''t help thinking this would have scored higher if the challenge was in Nov/Dec/Jan.  It''s out of season and honestly speaking I''m sure subconsciously that affects the score.  It would have affected my score, had I voted in this one. I like the picture, but I''m not entirely sure it portrays intimacy.', '2008-05-08 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4704195, 662165, 811, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The lighting is a bit harsh, but I like the subject choice</td>', 'Great capture.  The lighting is a bit harsh, but I like the subject choice', '2008-05-15 11:45:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4725418, 662146, 93976, '<td valign="top">Excellent work! Congrats.</td>', 'Excellent work! Congrats.', '2008-05-26 15:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4734243, 661390, 46177, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, the natural lighting is perfect for them.</td>', 'Sweet shot, the natural lighting is perfect for them.', '2008-05-30 08:42:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4760873, 662209, 68504, '<td valign="top">Beauty. Nothing wasted here.</td>', 'Beauty. Nothing wasted here.', '2008-06-10 01:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4765747, 662178, 20577, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think this is a fantastic photograph. I know everyone seems to think it is too blown out, but I love it. You should be very proud of this one.</td>', 'Personally, I think this is a fantastic photograph. I know everyone seems to think it is too blown out, but I love it. You should be very proud of this one.', '2008-06-12 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4804426, 660757, 95571, '<td valign="top">very,very intimate</td>', 'very,very intimate', '2008-07-05 12:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4842609, 661813, 30982, '<td valign="top">Real, delightful, and wonderful.  Excellent image!</td>', 'Real, delightful, and wonderful.  Excellent image!', '2008-07-24 09:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4845349, 661390, 88204, '<td valign="top">Dorothy passed away on 7/19/08, ending their 68 year marriage, just 4 days after Pete''s 99th birthday (about 4 months after this shot was taken). Pete is still going strong and sharp as ever but completely heartbroken after losing his sweetheart. They first met 85 years ago in 1923. They defined what love and marriage are all about.<br/> <br/>This was likely the last shot of them together.</td>', 'Dorothy passed away on 7/19/08, ending their 68 year marriage, just 4 days after Pete''s 99th birthday (about 4 months after this shot was taken). Pete is still going strong and sharp as ever but completely heartbroken after losing his sweetheart. They first met 85 years ago in 1923. They defined what love and marriage are all about. This was likely the last shot of them together.', '2008-07-26 01:37:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4884399, 661390, 60862, '<td valign="top">That is a BEAUTIFUL shot of special people.  I''m sorry to hear of her death, but that makes the image an even more important tribute.  It''s amazing they were married for 68 years when he was 31 at their wedding!  I can only hope my marriage lasts as long. :)</td>', 'That is a BEAUTIFUL shot of special people.  I''m sorry to hear of her death, but that makes the image an even more important tribute.  It''s amazing they were married for 68 years when he was 31 at their wedding!  I can only hope my marriage lasts as long. :)', '2008-08-13 01:16:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4943342, 661390, 53642, '<td valign="top">I love that they are such a beacon of hope for marriage these days. My parents, and grandparents have both stayed together and I am very lucky. It must be amazing to be with someone for so long, how great!! Praise God!!!</td>', 'I love that they are such a beacon of hope for marriage these days. My parents, and grandparents have both stayed together and I am very lucky. It must be amazing to be with someone for so long, how great!! Praise God!!!', '2008-09-08 22:48:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4950369, 661390, 88204, '<td valign="top">A fitting end to an 85 year love story...<br/> <br/>Pete passed away on 9/10/08, less than 2 months after Dorothy. He was as healthy as can be when she died. He spent the next month and a half getting all of their affairs in order, passing on prized possessions to family members and "wrapping up" all the details of their lives. He then got pneumonia and his 99 year old body that had been so healthy just couldn''t hold up.<br/> <br/>I think he was just heartbroken, missed the love of his life and his body decided it best if they were together.</td>', 'A fitting end to an 85 year love story... Pete passed away on 9/10/08, less than 2 months after Dorothy. He was as healthy as can be when she died. He spent the next month and a half getting all of their affairs in order, passing on prized possessions to family members and "wrapping up" all the details of their lives. He then got pneumonia and his 99 year old body that had been so healthy just couldn''t hold up. I think he was just heartbroken, missed the love of his life and his body decided it best if they were together.', '2008-09-11 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4955839, 661813, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great emotion and lighting in this. Love the hint of sepia tone in the photo it gives a beautiful love story feel to it.</td>', 'Great emotion and lighting in this. Love the hint of sepia tone in the photo it gives a beautiful love story feel to it.', '2008-09-15 08:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020591, 661390, 60614, '<td valign="top">Wow, I am so glad you won a ribbon otherwise I would never have seen this wonderful portrait.  This is such and awesome photo with a wonderful story behind it.</td>', 'Wow, I am so glad you won a ribbon otherwise I would never have seen this wonderful portrait.  This is such and awesome photo with a wonderful story behind it.', '2008-10-22 14:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5025329, 661346, 53147, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. These types of shots are what photography is all about IMO. Very nice.</td>', 'Lovely image. These types of shots are what photography is all about IMO. Very nice.', '2008-10-26 07:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5166240, 661813, 86379, '<td valign="top">what a sweet capture!</td>', 'what a sweet capture!', '2009-01-02 21:59:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5225834, 662174, 61961, '<td valign="top">Michael, in response to your forum comment... <br/>Although "intimacy" can infer privacy, I think the most common usage refers to close contact or connection with another person.  In short: close friendship or love, sensual or otherwise.  This photo (lovely as it is) could be seen as the opposite of that, since there is an objectified quality.  A woman undressed for you in a bedroom might be intimate, but a woman posing on a public beach in eye-catching colors is not.</td>', 'Michael, in response to your forum comment... Although "intimacy" can infer privacy, I think the most common usage refers to close contact or connection with another person.  In short: close friendship or love, sensual or otherwise.  This photo (lovely as it is) could be seen as the opposite of that, since there is an objectified quality.  A woman undressed for you in a bedroom might be intimate, but a woman posing on a public beach in eye-catching colors is not.', '2009-01-29 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5232070, 661681, 25678, '<td valign="top">I was out of the country when this one went by, so a very belated on a well deserved (about time!!) ribbon :)</td>', 'I was out of the country when this one went by, so a very belated on a well deserved (about time!!) ribbon :)', '2009-02-01 13:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
